# Coded intake data — generated locally by scripts/extract_et.py. These are the
# seed you paste into the private Sheet, plus an audit copy; the page itself
# reads the Sheet, not these. Never committed: a static site cannot gate a file
# served from its own repo, so nothing sensitive is allowed in here at all.
data/et.json
data/*.tsv

# Holds payee names, venue names and statement paths. Never commit.
scripts/*.local.json
